# `dfo::VnsMadsConfig`

Settings of variable-neighbourhood MADS: the base configuration plus the kicks.

`base` is the [`MadsBlackboxAdvancedConfig`](MadsBlackboxAdvancedConfig.md) used for each stage; its evaluation budget is divided among the `neighborhoods` stages. Before each later stage the best point is kicked by a normal draw of scale `initial_kick_scale`, which grows by `kick_growth` per stage so that later stages jump further.

## Fields

### `base`

`dfo::MadsBlackboxAdvancedConfig`, default `{}`.

The MADS settings used for each stage.

### `neighborhoods`

`std::int64_t`, default `5`.

Number of stages.

### `initial_kick_scale`

`double`, default `0.2`.

Scale of the first kick.

### `kick_growth`

`double`, default `1.7`.

Factor the kick scale grows by each stage.

### `rng_seed`

`std::uint64_t`, default `5489`.

Seed of the kicks.

## Guidance

Passed to `vnsmads_blackbox_minimizer`.

## Practical Examples

### Example 1

The kick scale.

@@run@@
```cpp
#include <pluss/ma.h>
#include <pluss/tils/kit/output.h>

using namespace pluss::tils;

namespace dfo = pluss::subsp::math::optimization;
using pluss::Series;

int main() {
  OutputEngine out;
  out.print_defaults(PrintOptions{}.fixed(5));
  const auto value = [](const Series &x) {
    const double pi = 3.14159265358979323846;
    return (x.square() - (x * (2.0 * pi)).cos() * 10.0 + 10.0).sum();   // minimum 0 at the origin, many local minima
  };

  const auto black_box = [&](const Series &x) { dfo::BlackboxEvaluation e; e.objectives = value(x).reshape({1}); return e; };
  for (const double kick : {0.1, 1.0, 3.0}) {
    dfo::VnsMadsConfig config;
    config.base.lower_bounds = pluss::series::make({-5.12, -5.12});
    config.base.upper_bounds = pluss::series::make({5.12, 5.12});
    config.base.max_evaluations = 9000;
    config.neighborhoods = 6;
    config.initial_kick_scale = kick;
    out.writeln("kick scale", kick, ": minimum =", dfo::vnsmads_blackbox_minimizer(black_box, pluss::series::make({3.2, 2.7}), config).scalarized_minimum);
  }
}
```

### Example 2

The kick growth.

@@run@@
```cpp
#include <pluss/ma.h>
#include <pluss/tils/kit/output.h>

using namespace pluss::tils;

namespace dfo = pluss::subsp::math::optimization;
using pluss::Series;

int main() {
  OutputEngine out;
  out.print_defaults(PrintOptions{}.fixed(5));
  const auto value = [](const Series &x) {
    const double pi = 3.14159265358979323846;
    return (x.square() - (x * (2.0 * pi)).cos() * 10.0 + 10.0).sum();   // minimum 0 at the origin, many local minima
  };

  const auto black_box = [&](const Series &x) { dfo::BlackboxEvaluation e; e.objectives = value(x).reshape({1}); return e; };
  for (const double growth : {1.0, 1.7, 2.5}) {
    dfo::VnsMadsConfig config;
    config.base.lower_bounds = pluss::series::make({-5.12, -5.12});
    config.base.upper_bounds = pluss::series::make({5.12, 5.12});
    config.base.max_evaluations = 9000;
    config.neighborhoods = 6;
    config.kick_growth = growth;
    out.writeln("kick growth", growth, ": minimum =", dfo::vnsmads_blackbox_minimizer(black_box, pluss::series::make({3.2, 2.7}), config).scalarized_minimum);
  }
}
```

### Example 3

Seeds. The kicks are random; the seed of the configuration and the base both matter.

@@run@@
```cpp
#include <pluss/ma.h>
#include <pluss/tils/kit/output.h>

using namespace pluss::tils;

namespace dfo = pluss::subsp::math::optimization;
using pluss::Series;

int main() {
  OutputEngine out;
  out.print_defaults(PrintOptions{}.fixed(5));
  const auto value = [](const Series &x) {
    const double pi = 3.14159265358979323846;
    return (x.square() - (x * (2.0 * pi)).cos() * 10.0 + 10.0).sum();   // minimum 0 at the origin, many local minima
  };

  const auto black_box = [&](const Series &x) { dfo::BlackboxEvaluation e; e.objectives = value(x).reshape({1}); return e; };
  for (const std::uint64_t seed : {1, 2, 3}) {
    dfo::VnsMadsConfig config;
    config.base.lower_bounds = pluss::series::make({-5.12, -5.12});
    config.base.upper_bounds = pluss::series::make({5.12, 5.12});
    config.base.max_evaluations = 9000;
    config.base.rng_seed = seed;
    config.rng_seed = seed;
    config.neighborhoods = 6;
    out.writeln("seed", seed, ": minimum =", dfo::vnsmads_blackbox_minimizer(black_box, pluss::series::make({3.2, 2.7}), config).scalarized_minimum);
  }
}
```

